e,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i2","label":"Did the staff extend a warm greeting and introduce themselves by name?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i3","label":"Did the staff convey the feeling that you were a valued guest?","photo_required":false,"pts":1},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i4","label":"Was your table properly set up?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i5","label":"Did the server announce his/her presence by saying, \u201cExcuse me sir / ma\u2019am  (use guest name if you are familiar) you ordered for <item/s>\u201d, while he / she is serving it on your table?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i6","label":"Serve drinks within 5 - 8 minutes?\nKindly remark actual time if drinks are served more than 8 minutes.","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i7","label":"Serve food not more than 20 minutes?\nKindly remark actual time if food are served more than 20 minutes.","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i8","label":"Did you receive your orders completely and correctly?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i9","label":"Did the server ask you if he has served all  your orders?\n\u201cExcuse me sir / ma\u2019am, have I served  all your orders?\u201d","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i10","label":"Did the server anticipate customer needs?\nEx. Extra plate, extra utensils, and condiments","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i11","label":"Did the staff thanked you and excused himself?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i12","label":"When you complained about your order, did the staff apologized and say he will fix it/ change it?\n\u201cI apologize that you are unhappy, may I change you order?\u201d","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i13","label":"Did the server remain attentive throughout the dining experience?","photo_required":false,"pts":5},{"id":"mstienma_s3_i14","label":"Was the Server wearing complete uniform 